# Render Multi-Service Deployment Protocol

For changes merged to `origin/main`:
1. `botbound-api` (`srv-daqamngu01pc73ffteeg`) auto-deploys from `main`.
2. `botbound-voice` (`srv-daqaoo97lnhs73cbapeg`) has `autoDeploy: no` configured. You MUST manually trigger its deploy via Render API:
   `POST https://api.render.com/v1/services/srv-daqaoo97lnhs73cbapeg/deploys` with body `{"clearCache":"do_not_clear"}`.
3. Poll both deploys until their status is `live`.
4. Run a live production health probe to `https://botbound.app/api/health/public` and confirm the service responds with HTTP 200 OK.
